    - rid: 4304780615459536933
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: greeting
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Greetings, traveler. You arrive at a dark hour. My son, Elian, is missing. He was investigating the old well. Goblins... I fear they took him. Find him, please, and I will reward you dearly.
        nextNodeId: greeting-choice
    - rid: 4304780615459536934
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: greeting-choice
        options:
        - text: I will find your son, Eldor.
          nextNodeId: accept-action
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
        - text: I have other matters.
          nextNodeId: decline-line
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
    - rid: 4304780615459536935
      type: {class: ActionNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: accept-action
        action:
          rid: 4304780615459536946
        nextNodeId: accept-line
    - rid: 4304780615459536936
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: accept-line
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Thank you. The well behind my manor... that is where he was last seen. May the gods watch over you.
        nextNodeId: end
    - rid: 4304780615459536937
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: decline-line
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Then pray they do not involve the safety of your own family.
        nextNodeId: end
    - rid: 4304780615459536938
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: already-accepted
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Please, hurry back with news of my son.
        nextNodeId: end
    - rid: 4304780615459536939
      type: {class: BranchNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: fate-known
        timelineKey: elian-alive
        secondTimelineKey: 
        conditionType: 0
        threshold: 0
        trueNodeId: joyful-line
        falseNodeId: grief-line
    - rid: 4304780615459536940
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: joyful-line
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Elian! My boy! Safe! Oh, thank the gods. Words cannot express my gratitude, traveler.
        nextNodeId: give-ring
    - rid: 4304780615459536941
      type: {class: ActionNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: give-ring
        action:
          rid: 4304780615459536947
        nextNodeId: ring-line
    - rid: 4304780615459536942
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: ring-line
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: Take this family heirloom -- a Ring of Protection. It saved my father; may it save you.
        nextNodeId: end
    - rid: 4304780615459536943
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: grief-line
        speakerName: Eldor
        text: (Sobbing) The locket... it was his mother's. You promised you would find him! You failed us... Leave me. Leave Oakhaven. Your presence is a curse.
        nextNodeId: grief-action
    - rid: 4304780615459536944
      type: {class: ActionNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: grief-action
        action:
          rid: 4304780615459536948
        nextNodeId: end
